# Verda's plants, produce and wildlife (Prototypes/_WF/Planets/Life/verda.yml and verda_mobs.yml).

wf-verda-bramble-lash = The bramble lashes at you!

ent-WFVerdaMushroom = forest mushroom
    .desc = A brown-capped mushroom from the forest floor. Cook two in a big bowl with water for a soup.
ent-WFFoodSoupVerdaMushroom = forest mushroom soup
    .desc = A thick, earthy soup of forest mushrooms.
ent-WFVerdaDuskberries = duskberries
    .desc = Small, dusky berries picked wild. Tart, but they fill you up.
ent-WFVerdaShoreSage = shore sage
    .desc = Thick, sappy leaves that grow at the waterline. Eat them to ease cuts and burns, or cut them up to bind on a wound.
ent-WFVerdaLotusBlossom = lotus blossom
    .desc = A pink pond lotus. It's safe to eat and mends a little of what ails you.
ent-WFVerdaBrambleThorn = bramble thorn
    .desc = A hooked thorn cut from a snapping bramble.
ent-WFVerdaGlowroot = glowroot
    .desc = A root that glows green. It's laced with uranium: grind it for the reagent, and don't eat it.

ent-WFVerdaPlantMushroom = forest mushrooms
    .desc = A patch of brown-capped mushrooms in the leaf litter. They're good to eat, and they grow back after picking.
ent-WFVerdaPlantBerryBush = berry bush
    .desc = A bush hung with dusky berries. Pick them while they're ripe; it regrows.
ent-WFVerdaPlantReeds = lake reeds
    .desc = Tall reeds with tough stalks. Cut the stalks for plant fibre; they regrow.
ent-WFVerdaPlantShoreSage = shore sage
    .desc = A medicinal herb that grows right at the water's edge. Pick it to heal with, and it grows back.
ent-WFVerdaPlantLotus = pond lotus
    .desc = A lotus floating on the mud, in flower. You can pick the blossom and eat it to heal a little; it grows back.
ent-WFVerdaPlantBramble = snapping bramble
    .desc = A snarl of barbed canes that lash at anything that comes close, and redden when they do. A knife cuts thorns from it.
ent-WFVerdaPlantGlowroot = glowroot plant
    .desc = A glowing green weed fed by the poisoned soil. It irradiates anything that comes within a tile and a half. Its roots carry uranium.

ent-WFMobVerdaDeer = mutated deer
    .desc = A deer with a sickly glow under its hide. It startles easily and bolts when it sees you.
ent-WFMobVerdaDoe = mutated doe
    .desc = A doe with a sickly glow under its hide. It startles easily and bolts when it sees you.
ent-WFMobVerdaDeerCharger = charging stag
    .desc = A glowing stag with its head down and its hooves scraping. It does not mean to run.
ent-WFMobVerdaDeerTwoHeaded = two-headed deer
    .desc = A stag grown huge and wrong in the irradiated soil, with a second head on its neck. Both of them are looking at you.
ent-WFMobVerdaScarRat = irradiated rat
    .desc = A rat grown big and mean on poisoned ground. It runs in packs.
ent-WFMobVerdaRatKing = scar rat king
    .desc = He's da rat, and he's got da pack. The ground he rules makes him bigger.
ent-WFMobVerdaFrostBear = frost bear
    .desc = A white bear of the highland snows, ice-blue light running under its fur. It will take whatever walks into its territory.
